# =============================================================================
# Nushell environment configuration
# =============================================================================
#
# Current Nushell guidance allows environment variables to be configured in
# config.nu. This file is retained because Nushell recognizes and loads it
# before config.nu, and it provides a place for settings that must be applied
# especially early in startup.
#
# Add machine-specific PATH changes here only when they cannot be handled by
# the operating system, package manager, or an installation script.